         -* ICY DRAW #VERSION *-

A modern text and retro graphics art editor.

- Written in pure rust
- Multi platform Windows, OSX, Linux
- ANSI/ASCII, RIPscrip, IGS & SkyPix editors
- PETSCII, ATASCII & Atari ST VT52 editors
- Layers, nested groups & editable effects
- Brushes, fills, shapes & halfblock drawing
- Editable TheDraw text & bitmap fonts
- AI drawing assistant & image import
- Moebius-compatible collaboration
- Autosave & crash recovery
- PNG-based .icy files with embedded previews
- ANSI, XBIN, ADF, Avatar, PCBoard, iCE,
  Tundra Draw, CtrlA & Renegade formats
- Palettes, RGB/iCE colors & SAUCE metadata
- Animation, GIF & PNG export
- Lua plugins & MCP automation
- 3D accelerated, Copy & Paste

For latest builds/development visit:
GitHub https://github.com/mkrueger/icy_tools